ِلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> نَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رًا ف</span>َلَمْ يَجِدُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>ُونِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نص</span>َارًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٥</span>"},{"id":26,"tajweed":"وَقَالَ نُو<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">حٌ ر</span>َّبِّ لَا تَذَرْ عَلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِرِينَ دَيَّارًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٦</span>"},{"id":27,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكَ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َذَرْهُمْ يُضِلُّو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عِبَادَكَ وَلَا يَلِد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> إِلَّا فَاجِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رًا ك</span>َفَّارًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٧</span>"},{"id":28,"tajweed":"رَّبِّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>غْفِرْ لِى وَلِو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِدَىَّ وَلِمَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>َخَلَ بَيْتِىَ مُؤْمِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نًا و</span>َلِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُؤْمِنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ وَلَا تَزِدِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِمِينَ إِلَّا تَبَارَۢا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٨</span>"}]}